<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<title>Affidavit of Financial Support</title>
<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  h1, h2, h3 {
    font-family: "DejaVu Sans", "Liberation Sans", Arial, sans-serif;
    font-weight: bold;
  }
  table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  td, th {
    padding: 8px;
    text-align: left;
  }
  .header-info {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    margin-bottom: 30px;
  }
  .logo-area {
    text-align: left;
  }
  .csun-info {
    text-align: right;
  }
  .section-title {
    font-size: 14pt;
    margin-top: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .divider {
    border-top: 1px solid #000;
    margin: 20px 0;
  }
  .form-row {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
  }
  .form-group {
    width: 48%;
  }
  .full-width-row {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
  }
  .signature-area {
    margin-top: 50px;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="page">
  <div class="header-info">
    <div class="logo-area">
      <img src="placeholder_csun_logo.png" alt="CSUN Logo" style="height: 60px;">
      <p>CALIFORNIA</p>
      <p>STATE UNIVERSITY</p>
      <p>NORTHRIDGE</p>
    </div>
    <div class="csun-info">
      <p>CSUN Office of Admissions</p>
      <p>International Admissions</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <h1>AFFIDAVIT OF FINANCIAL SUPPORT</h1>

  <p>If you wish to be in F-1 visa status as a student admitted to CSUN, you are required to <span data-field="action_required">{{ action_required }}</span> and provide supporting financial documents to demonstrate your ability to pay all tuition, living expenses and health insurance for the first year of your academic program.</p>

  <p>Download and save this fillable form <span data-field="action_link">{{ action_link }}</span>. Print the completed form and collect the required signatures. Then scan the completed form and upload it to your Cal State Apply application or the CSUN Portal.</p>

  <div class="section-title">DOCUMENTATION REQUIREMENTS</div>

  <ol>
    <li>Your documents must be dated <span data-field="date_requirement">{{ date_requirement }}</span> or later for FALL applicants, or <span data-field="date_requirement_2">{{ date_requirement_2 }}</span> or later for SPRING applicants.</li>
    <li>Official bank/financial statement(s) must show your sponsor's names(s) and the amount available.</li>
    <li>You will also need to submit a copy of the photo page of your current passport.</li>
  </ol>

  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 30px;">
    <div style="width: 48%;">
      <h3 style="font-size: 12pt;">Acceptable Financial Documents</h3>
      <ul>
        <li><span data-field="doc_type_1">{{ doc_type_1 }}</span></li>
        <li><span data-field="doc_type_2">{{ doc_type_2 }}</span></li>
        <li><span data-field="doc_type_3">{{ doc_type_3 }}</span></li>
        <li><span data-field="doc_type_4">{{ doc_type_4 }}</span></li>
        <li><span data-field="doc_type_5">{{ doc_type_5 }}</span></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div style="width: 48%;">
      <h3 style="font-size: 12pt;">Unacceptable Financial Documents</h3>
      <ul>
        <li><span data-field="unacceptable_1">{{ unacceptable_1 }}</span></li>
        <li><span data-field="unacceptable_2">{{ unacceptable_2 }}</span></li>
        <li><span data-field="unacceptable_3">{{ unacceptable_3 }}</span></li>
        <li><span data-field="unacceptable_4">{{ unacceptable_4 }}</span></li>
        <li><span data-field="unacceptable_5">{{ unacceptable_5 }}</span></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="section-title">ESTIMATED EXPENSES FOR ONE ACADEMIC YEAR (TWO SEMESTERS) BY CLASS LEVEL</div>

  <table style="margin-top: 15px;">
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th style="width: 30%;">Expenses</th>
        <th style="width: 35%; text-align: center;">Undergraduate Students (24 Units / 2 Semesters)</th>
        <th style="width: 35%; text-align: center;">Graduate Students (18 Units / 2 Semesters)</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td>Tuition</td>
        <td style="text-align: center;"><span data-field="tuition_ug">{{ tuition_ug }}</span></td>
        <td style="text-align: center;"><span data-field="tuition_grad">{{ tuition_grad }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>Living Expenses *</td>
        <td style="text-align: center;"><span data-field="living_ug">{{ living_ug }}</span></td>
        <td style="text-align: center;"><span data-field="living_grad">{{ living_grad }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>Health Insurance (12-month coverage)</td>
        <td style="text-align: center;"><span data-field="health_ug">{{ health_ug }}</span></td>
        <td style="text-align: center;"><span data-field="health_grad">{{ health_grad }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>Total Required</td>
        <td style="text-align: center;"><span data-field="total_ug">{{ total_ug }}</span></td>
        <td style="text-align: center;"><span data-field="total_grad">{{ total_grad }}</span></td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>
  <p style="font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 5px;">* Living Expenses: Housing and Food; Books, Course Materials, Supplies and Equipment; Transportation; and Other Personal/Miscellaneous Expenses.</p>

  <div class="section-title">PROFESSIONAL GRADUATE PROGRAMS WITH HIGHER TOTAL ESTIMATED EXPENSES</div>

  <table style="margin-top: 15px;">
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th style="width: 70%;">Professional Graduate Program</th>
        <th style="width: 30%; text-align: right;">Estimated Total Expenses for One Academic Year</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      {% for program in professional_programs %}
      <tr>
        <td><span data-field="program.name">{{ program.name }}</span></td>
        <td style="text-align: right;"><span data-field="program.estimated_cost">{{ program.estimated_cost }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <p style="text-align: center; margin-top: 40px;">Please continue to Page 2 of this form.</p>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div class="header-info">
    <div class="logo-area">
      <p>CSUN</p>
    </div>
    <div class="csun-info">
      <p>AFFIDAVIT OF FINANCIAL SUPPORT FOR F-1 INTERNATIONAL STUDENTS, page 2 of 2</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="section-title">STUDENT INFORMATION</div>

  <div class="form-row">
    <div class="form-group">
      Student's Family Name: <span data-field="student_family_name">{{ student_family_name }}</span>
    </div>
    <div class="form-group">
      Student's First Name: <span data-field="student_first_name">{{ student_first_name }}</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-row">
    <div class="form-group">
      CSUN Student ID Number (nine digits): <span data-field="csun_student_id">{{ csun_student_id }}</span>
    </div>
    <div class="form-group">
      Date of Birth (month/day/year): <span data-field="date_of_birth">{{ date_of_birth }}</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="divider"></div>

  <div class="section-title">FINANCIAL SPONSOR INFORMATION</div>

  <p>By signing below, your sponsor certifies that sufficient financial resources will be available to cover your expenses for your studies at CSUN. If necessary, use an extra sheet of paper.</p>

  <table style="margin-top: 15px;">
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th style="width: 25%;">Full Name, Sponsor #1</th>
        <th style="width: 25%;">Sponsor #1 Relationship to Applicant</th>
        <th style="width: 25%;">Sponsor #1 Signature</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td><span data-field="sponsor_1_name">{{ sponsor_1_name }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="sponsor_1_relationship">{{ sponsor_1_relationship }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="sponsor_1_signature_line">{{ sponsor_1_signature_line }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><span data-field="sponsor_2_name">{{ sponsor_2_name }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="sponsor_2_relationship">{{ sponsor_2_relationship }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="sponsor_2_signature_line">{{ sponsor_2_signature_line }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><span data-field="sponsor_3_name">{{ sponsor_3_name }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="sponsor_3_relationship">{{ sponsor_3_relationship }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="sponsor_3_signature_line">{{ sponsor_3_signature_line }}</span></td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <div class="divider"></div>

  <div class="section-title">F-2 VISA DEPENDENT INFORMATION</div>

  <p>If you will be accompanied by your spouse and/or children, you must show documentation of <span data-field="additional_funds_note">{{ additional_funds_note }}</span>. Also submit a copy of the <span data-field="photo_page_note">{{ photo_page_note }}</span> of each dependent's current passport. If necessary, use an extra sheet of paper.</p>

  <table style="margin-top: 15px;">
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th style="width: 25%;">Spouse's Family/Last Name</th>
        <th style="width: 20%;">Spouse's First Name</th>
        <th style="width: 15%;">Gender (M/F)</th>
        <th style="width: 15%;">Date of Birth</th>
        <th style="width: 15%;">Country of Birth</th>
        <th style="width: 10%;">Country of Citizenship</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td><span data-field="spouse_family_name">{{ spouse_family_name }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="spouse_first_name">{{ spouse_first_name }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="spouse_gender">{{ spouse_gender }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="spouse_dob">{{ spouse_dob }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="spouse_country_of_birth">{{ spouse_country_of_birth }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="spouse_country_of_citizenship">{{ spouse_country_of_citizenship }}</span></td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <table style="margin-top: 15px;">
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th style="width: 25%;">Child #1 Family/Last Name</th>
        <th style="width: 20%;">Child #1 First Name</th>
        <th style="width: 15%;">Gender (M/F)</th>
        <th style="width: 15%;">Date of Birth</th>
        <th style="width: 15%;">Country of Birth</th>
        <th style="width: 10%;">Country of Citizenship</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td><span data-field="child1_family_name">{{ child1_family_name }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="child1_first_name">{{ child1_first_name }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="child1_gender">{{ child1_gender }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="child1_dob">{{ child1_dob }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="child1_country_of_birth">{{ child1_country_of_birth }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="child1_country_of_citizenship">{{ child1_country_of_citizenship }}</span></td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <table style="margin-top: 15px;">
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th style="width: 25%;">Child #2 Family/Last Name</th>
        <th style="width: 20%;">Child #2 First Name</th>
        <th style="width: 15%;">Gender (M/F)</th>
        <th style="width: 15%;">Date of Birth</th>
        <th style="width: 15%;">Country of Birth</th>
        <th style="width: 10%;">Country of Citizenship</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td><span data-field="child2_family_name">{{ child2_family_name }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="child2_first_name">{{ child2_first_name }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="child2_gender">{{ child2_gender }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="child2_dob">{{ child2_dob }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="child2_country_of_birth">{{ child2_country_of_birth }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="child2_country_of_citizenship">{{ child2_country_of_citizenship }}</span></td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <div class="divider"></div>

  <div class="section-title">I-20 TRANSFEROR STATUS</div>

  <p>Please answer the questions below so that we can create your new Form I-20 correctly:</p>

  <div class="form-row" style="justify-content: flex-start;">
    <div style="width: 50%;">
      <p>1. Are you currently living <span data-field="location_status">{{ location_status }}</span> and will need a new I-20?</p>
      <label><input type="radio" name="q1" value="yes"> Yes</label>
      <label><input type="radio" name="q1" value="no"> No</label>
    </div>
    <div style="width: 50%;">
      <p>2. Are you transferring to CSUN from a school <span data-field="transfer_status">{{ transfer_status }}</span> (including a language school, high school, college or university)?</p>
      <label><input type="radio" name="q2" value="yes"> Yes</label>
      <label><input type="radio" name="q2" value="no"> No</label>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="divider"></div>

  <div class="section-title">APPLICANT AGREEMENT</div>

  <p>This is to certify that all information on this form is complete and accurate to the best of my knowledge. If I am admitted to CSUN, I am aware that I must submit acceptable financial documents and a copy of the photo page of my current passport in order for CSUN to create my new I-20. I am also fully aware that submitting fraudulent documents may result in denial of admission.</p>

  <div class="signature-area">
    <div style="width: 45%;">
      <p>Applicant/Student Signature</p>
      <p style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000; margin-top: 40px;"></p>
    </div>
    <div style="width: 45%;">
      <p>Signature Date</p>
      <p style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000; margin-top: 40px;"></p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 60px; text-align: center; font-size: 10pt;">
    Office of Admissions, <span data-field="admissions_link">{{ admissions_link }}</span> | Email: <span data-field="admissions_email">{{ admissions_email }}</span> | Tel: <span data-field="admissions_phone">{{ admissions_phone }}</span>
  </div>
</div>

</body>
</html>